  "title": "Spinach Artichoke Dip from Reynolds Wrap®",
  "description": "Creamy, cheesy spinach-artichoke dip is baked in Reynolds Wrap® Pan Lining Paper for easy clean-up.",
  "authors": [
    "Reynolds KitchensR"
  ],
